tool_call: {"query": "returns refund policy duplicate accidental purchase return window"}
tool_result: {"ok": true, "results": [{"policy_id": "cw-returns", "score": 4.316, "snippet": "# Cartwheel return policy\n\nItems bought on Cartwheel can be returned within 30 days of delivery. The window counts from the delivery date, not the purchase date. Items must be in the condition described by the store's listing. Individual stores may override this window; see the store overrides polic", "title": "Cartwheel return policy"}, {"policy_id": "cw-refunds", "score": 3.239, "snippet": "# Cartwheel refund policy\n\nApproved refunds go back to the original payment method and arrive in 5 to 10 business days. Refunds of 100 dollars or less execute automatically once the order passes the eligibility check. Refunds above 100 dollars are queued for review by a human support agent before an", "title": "Cartwheel refund policy"}, {"policy_id": "cw-shipping", "score": 2.802, "snippet": "# Cartwheel shipping policy\n\nStores ship orders within 3 days of purchase. Standard delivery takes up to 7 days in transit after shipment. Tracking is available on the order page once the store marks the order shipped.", "title": "Cartwheel shipping policy"}]}
assistant: I’m going to open the return and refund policy details to confirm the time window, refund timing, and any store-specific notes before I advise you.
tool_call: {"policy_id": "cw-returns"}
tool_result: {"audience": "all", "body": "# Cartwheel return policy\n\nItems bought on Cartwheel can be returned within 30 days of delivery. The window counts from the delivery date, not the purchase date. Items must be in the condition described by the store's listing. Individual stores may override this window; see the store overrides policy and the store's own policy page.", "ok": true, "policy_id": "cw-returns", "title": "Cartwheel return policy"}
tool_call: {"policy_id": "cw-refunds"}
tool_result: {"audience": "all", "body": "# Cartwheel refund policy\n\nApproved refunds go back to the original payment method and arrive in 5 to 10 business days. Refunds of 100 dollars or less execute automatically once the order passes the eligibility check. Refunds above 100 dollars are queued for review by a human support agent before any money moves.", "ok": true, "policy_id": "cw-refunds", "title": "Cartwheel refund policy"}
assistant: I’m also going to search your own orders for the bowl name, because order 3364 contains one bowl and you may have a separate duplicate order for the second one.
tool_call: {"query": "Speckled Serving Bowl"}
tool_result: {"ok": true, "orders": [{"delivered_at": "2026-06-10", "order_id": 3364, "ordered_at": "2026-06-01", "product_id": 22, "quantity": 1, "refund_eligible": true, "shipped_at": "2026-06-04", "status": "delivered", "store_id": 1, "total_usd": 89}]}
assistant: I’ll check the store override policy too, because Cartwheel’s return policy says individual stores may change the standard return window.
tool_call: {"query": "store overrides Blue Heron Ceramics return policy returns window"}
tool_result: {"ok": true, "results": [{"policy_id": "cw-returns", "score": 5.607, "snippet": "# Cartwheel return policy\n\nItems bought on Cartwheel can be returned within 30 days of delivery. The window counts from the delivery date, not the purchase date. Items must be in the condition described by the store's listing. Individual stores may override this window; see the store overrides polic", "title": "Cartwheel return policy"}, {"policy_id": "store-meridian-cycles-policy", "score": 3.13, "snippet": "# Meridian Cycles store policy\n\nMeridian Cycles accepts returns within 21 days of delivery, instead of the Cartwheel platform default of 30 days. This store window takes precedence for all Meridian Cycles orders.", "title": "Meridian Cycles store policy"}, {"policy_id": "store-northwind-books-policy", "score": 3.13, "snippet": "# Northwind Books store policy\n\nNorthwind Books accepts returns within 45 days of delivery, instead of the Cartwheel platform default of 30 days. This store window takes precedence for all Northwind Books orders.", "title": "Northwind Books store policy"}]}
assistant: I’m going to search specifically for Blue Heron Ceramics’ store policy, since that is the store on order 3364.
tool_call: {"query": "Blue Heron Ceramics store policy returns"}
tool_result: {"ok": true, "results": [{"policy_id": "store-meridian-cycles-policy", "score": 2.65, "snippet": "# Meridian Cycles store policy\n\nMeridian Cycles accepts returns within 21 days of delivery, instead of the Cartwheel platform default of 30 days. This store window takes precedence for all Meridian Cycles orders.", "title": "Meridian Cycles store policy"}, {"policy_id": "store-northwind-books-policy", "score": 2.65, "snippet": "# Northwind Books store policy\n\nNorthwind Books accepts returns within 45 days of delivery, instead of the Cartwheel platform default of 30 days. This store window takes precedence for all Northwind Books orders.", "title": "Northwind Books store policy"}, {"policy_id": "store-saltbox-pantry-policy", "score": 2.65, "snippet": "# Saltbox Pantry store policy\n\nSaltbox Pantry accepts returns within 7 days of delivery, instead of the Cartwheel platform default of 30 days. This store window takes precedence for all Saltbox Pantry orders.", "title": "Saltbox Pantry store policy"}]}
assistant: Not silly at all — accidental duplicate buys happen.

I checked order **3364**: it’s for **1 × Speckled Serving Bowl** from **Blue Heron Ceramics**, total **$89**, and the order is currently marked **refund-eligible**. I also searched your Cartwheel orders for the same bowl and only found **order 3364** — I don’t see a second Speckled Serving Bowl order in your Cartwheel account.

So, **yes: if order 3364 is the bowl/order you want to return, it can be handled as a return/refund**. Cartwheel’s standard return policy allows returns within **30 days of delivery**, and the item needs to be in the condition described by the store’s listing; stores can set their own override policies where applicable (**cw-returns**). Approved refunds go back to the **original payment method** and usually arrive in **5–10 business days**; refunds of **$100 or less** process automatically once the order passes the eligibility check (**cw-refunds**). Since this order is **$89** and is marked eligible, it falls within that automatic range.

I haven’t processed the refund yet, because I want to make sure we don’t refund the wrong thing. Please reply with one of these:

1. **“Yes, refund order 3364”** — if you want to return/refund that bowl for **$89**.  
2. **“I want to keep order 3364 but return the extra bowl”** — if the second bowl may have been sent by mistake; since I don’t see a second matching order, I’d route that to a human support agent to sort out safely.

